{"4667340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rome City Builder", "steam_appid": 4667340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rome City Builder</strong> is a 3D city builder and colony sim where you lead a Roman settlement to survival and growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources, construct buildings, automate production, and command your forces in real-time tactical battles against relentless enemy waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choices you make how you expand, defend, and manage your time will determine how long your city survives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4667340/extras/6c0f001be66e6c008f64bb0dd4982e38.poster.avif?t=1778149673\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4667340/extras/6c0f001be66e6c008f64bb0dd4982e38.webm?t=1778149673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4667340/extras/6c0f001be66e6c008f64bb0dd4982e38.mp4?t=1778149673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A city building and colony simulation experience combined with real-time tactics and wargame combat in an atmospheric Roman setting.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4667340/extras/16b3cb85d099d89a38877568faf3cad4.poster.avif?t=1778149673\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4667340/extras/16b3cb85d099d89a38877568faf3cad4.webm?t=1778149673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4667340/extras/16b3cb85d099d89a38877568faf3cad4.mp4?t=1778149673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage a growing settlement by gathering resources, planning infrastructure, and automating production to sustain expansion and defense.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4667340/extras/c67de0ab7c4c3d94fbfc02c3d6569dd8.poster.avif?t=1778149673\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4667340/extras/c67de0ab7c4c3d94fbfc02c3d6569dd8.webm?t=1778149673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4667340/extras/c67de0ab7c4c3d94fbfc02c3d6569dd8.mp4?t=1778149673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take direct control of workers and military units, issuing commands for construction, resource gathering, movement, and combat across the battlefield.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4667340/extras/23821145ec39c7d960662cc3f4a58f94.poster.avif?t=1778149673\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4667340/extras/23821145ec39c7d960662cc3f4a58f94.webm?t=1778149673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4667340/extras/23821145ec39c7d960662cc3f4a58f94.mp4?t=1778149673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face escalating enemy waves that grow stronger each day, forcing constant adaptation of strategy, defenses, and army composition.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4667340/extras/b3a61b32c0c2c934c17fa27e5d403a0f.poster.avif?t=1778149673\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4667340/extras/b3a61b32c0c2c934c17fa27e5d403a0f.webm?t=1778149673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4667340/extras/b3a61b32c0c2c934c17fa27e5d403a0f.mp4?t=1778149673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dynamic day and night cycle shapes progression, where time management and acceleration up to 3x are key to optimizing growth and survival.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rome City Builder</strong> is a 3D city builder and colony sim where you lead a Roman settlement to survival and growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources, construct buildings, automate production, and command your forces in real-time tactical battles against relentless enemy waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choices you make how you expand, defend, and manage your time will determine how long your city survives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4667340/extras/6c0f001be66e6c008f64bb0dd4982e38.poster.avif?t=1778149673\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4667340/extras/6c0f001be66e6c008f64bb0dd4982e38.webm?t=1778149673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4667340/extras/6c0f001be66e6c008f64bb0dd4982e38.mp4?t=1778149673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A city building and colony simulation experience combined with real-time tactics and wargame combat in an atmospheric Roman setting.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4667340/extras/16b3cb85d099d89a38877568faf3cad4.poster.avif?t=1778149673\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4667340/extras/16b3cb85d099d89a38877568faf3cad4.webm?t=1778149673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4667340/extras/16b3cb85d099d89a38877568faf3cad4.mp4?t=1778149673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage a growing settlement by gathering resources, planning infrastructure, and automating production to sustain expansion and defense.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4667340/extras/c67de0ab7c4c3d94fbfc02c3d6569dd8.poster.avif?t=1778149673\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4667340/extras/c67de0ab7c4c3d94fbfc02c3d6569dd8.webm?t=1778149673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4667340/extras/c67de0ab7c4c3d94fbfc02c3d6569dd8.mp4?t=1778149673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take direct control of workers and military units, issuing commands for construction, resource gathering, movement, and combat across the battlefield.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4667340/extras/23821145ec39c7d960662cc3f4a58f94.poster.avif?t=1778149673\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4667340/extras/23821145ec39c7d960662cc3f4a58f94.webm?t=1778149673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4667340/extras/23821145ec39c7d960662cc3f4a58f94.mp4?t=1778149673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face escalating enemy waves that grow stronger each day, forcing constant adaptation of strategy, defenses, and army composition.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4667340/extras/b3a61b32c0c2c934c17fa27e5d403a0f.poster.avif?t=1778149673\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4667340/extras/b3a61b32c0c2c934c17fa27e5d403a0f.webm?t=1778149673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4667340/extras/b3a61b32c0c2c934c17fa27e5d403a0f.mp4?t=1778149673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dynamic day and night cycle shapes progression, where time management and acceleration up to 3x are key to optimizing growth and survival.</p>", "short_description": "Build your Roman city. Gather resources, build structures, train soldiers and defend against Barbarians at night. How many days can your civilization last?", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Dutch, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4667340/ad618be8287ee493907df8255b8351487aa67973/header.jpg?t=1778149673", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4667340/27901bb144d328e0bce7be224bf721b8ea2e1d74/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1778149673", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4667340/27901bb144d328e0bce7be224bf721b8ea2e1d74/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1778149673", "website": "https://www.urban